    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d313-a2">

                <pb facs="0727" n="679" xml:id="pg679"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-02-26"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >February</hi> 26, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> The Bizen retainer who gave the order to
                    fire against the legations of the treaty powers is at present in the province of
                    Bizen. He will be at once dispatched to Hiogo, and punishment will be inflicted
                    on him. With respect and consideration,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HIGASHI KUSE SAKI NO SHO SHO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. B. Van Vankenburgh</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">American Minister.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
